 "notes": [
  "Kit batch 2005+ (lane kit-batch-2005-20261121), hand-authored from the archived crops: panel 192 (E, 17.1 m) -> group 0 and panel 106 (the banded pavilion beside it, 5.7 m) -> group 1 from w08-84 2021-03-26; panel 98 (S, 26.5 m, the north side of the square) -> group 2 from w07-175 2016-08-12 (no later crop of it); panels 123, 241 and 10 (W, 16.7 m together, the Hotel Not Hotel front) -> group 3 from w09-264 2025-07-31.",
  "Not modelled, no usable crop: w01-84 (67.5 m, the colonnade and the domed corner) is a close oblique 2016 view of the corner pavilion; w06-84 is a close oblique view of a shopfront; w02-264 and w04-264 show the pre-war blocks in front of the pand's party walls; w03-355 and w05-174 have no crop. Those walls and the courtyard take otherWalls window-grid.",
  "The kit cannot say: the dome and pediment of the corner pavilion, the colonnade, the curved cast-iron balcony stack (drawn as straight barred balconies), the round attic oculi (drawn as small square windows), the stepped set-back crowns and the heavy multi-member cornices (one cornice plus double floor bands); the Van Speijkstraat garage passage is drawn as a storage leaf because the kit garage door is skipped on a residential ground."
 ],
